Hello New Salem witches and wizards! An important update was made to the game, bringing several improvements. Just to name the main ones:
- MUCH improved game performance;
- New basic shooting system (which improved gameplay);
- Implemented magic teleportal system;
- Improved difficulty system;
- Dubbing in some dialogues and in the gameplay;
- Added village sidequest;
- New music for the forest area;
- Several bugs were fixed, among them the infamous ladder's bug.
- Among many other improvements!

Download the Spell Crisis DEMO from the store page and enjoy!
